INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1165,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8899038','Revamping of Chronic Respiratory Diseases in Low- and Middle-Income Countries.','Zeng LH, Hussain M, Syed SK, Saadullah M, Jamil Q, Alqahtani AM, Alqahtani T, Akram N, Khan IA, Parveen S, Fayyaz T, Fatima M, Shaukat S, Shabbir N, Fatima M, Kanwal A, Barkat MQ, Wu X.','2022','endure asymmetrically crds ptld crds indigence livelihood pertinence crds contending irresistible counteraction earnest sdss crds crds histiocytosis twain crds ptld aggravation probity fixates ailment destitution destroying exhibition crds crds crds inopportune disturb crds pervasion crds crds disappears squeal crds obliterans stunting stoves guatemalan stoves fvc stove trucks petrol crds soda crds crds ailment stumbling sabas labas peril instantly daiy inhalers formoterol sabas formoterol reliever reliever unaffordable salbutamol theophylline cadres preventer inhalers inhaler colonizing suspects crds colonizing fvc ptld unjustified retreatment subjecting ptld ptld ptld ptld ptld ptld ptld medicates ptld ptld crds crds badly untrained ptld crds dependable crds formoterol lama presuming unaffordability pharmacoeconomic compassionately crds pats mecor pats mecor crds crds crds crds crds crds mof mef sks lty21h160001 bonita kruk countdown stuttard bukhman mocumbi atun binagwaho ncdi s438 112aw agust noell faner willemse visagie czovek nduru vanker thoraxjnl sonnappa spirometric hostage burney rjt burney jithoo janson mannino nizankowska mogilnicka thoraxjnl rangarajan kurmi fev1 e613 turkovic willemse visagie vanker drakenstein 0188oc kaali delimini burkart opoku cookstove 0694oc macginty kariuki wedderburn comppsych ranabhat jakovljevic dhimal fiscus currier chipato nejmoa1511691 kotecha mcgarvey thoraxjnl mceniery cockcroft 0016oc vanker zar famoroti sibanda ndung tjb s12887 sinaniotis s197 s1526 sly ruchirawat barriga aogh zar stadler lubbe myer drakenstein keeffe arnott masekela moodley kitchin risenga spectre ij