INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(1235,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12389968','Therapeutic Vaccines for Non-Communicable Diseases: Global Progress and China''s Deployment Pathways.','Huang Y, Lyu X, Kam YW.','2025','chictr nmpa firms mckinsey reputable cimavax neutralize cimavax cimavax gpc3 vaxx cellgramdc oncovax neovax sipuleucel cyt006 angqb inclisiran cyt013 il1bqb cad106 cimavax kazakhstan gpc3 herizon nct02795988 nextherizon nct05311176 cellgramdc oncovax neovax sipuleucel cyt006 angqb inclisiran inclisiran remodel provenge paps cimavax sipuleucel inclisiran dsylipidemia oncovax neovax gpc3 unaddressed inclisiran cyt013 il1bqb vlps bht proinsulin proinsulin riddled underfunded angqb cyt006 biovaxid idiotype costlier stagnated vaxx rollout unaffordable unevenly deepens evo messengers microneedles taxing gavi subsidies amrh asean evo evo neutralize hinges messengers ambassadors influencers debunking microneedles intimidating hinges alarmingly taxing commodities subsidies incentivizing subsidies philanthropic gavi subsidies subsidized subsidies deductions mckinsey chobani mras prequalification covax amrh asean dossier cimavax domestically heaviest multifactor hesitation sprays microneedle kunshan startup kunshan 00akug0130 kunshan vizhub gbd_2021_booklet_final_2024 emro emro breman measham alleyne claeson musgrove nbk10246 vetrano rizzuto larranaga onder welmer bernabei marengoni fratiglioni e1002503 omotayo maduka muonde olorunsogo ogugua imsrj v4i1 nmh nvi nmh nvi darrow kesselheim kashutina fadeeva zhernov vaccines11081286 leidner chesson biggerstaff stoecker dooling s12929 nakamaru nakagami rakugi morishita circj s43556 crombet catala mirabal marinello guillen s11427 santiesteban amador robaina cimavax oatext cimavax paramo alsina sarmiento alsina tul inguanzo elejalde larrinaga lamadrid corrales otero cimavax jca maglakelidze andric ryspayeva bulat nikolic petrovic nagarkar vaxx herizon koido taguchi shimabuku bito misawa uchiyama saruta tsukinaga mult